WEBVTT

00:07.549 --> 00:08.800
[lighter flicks]

00:18.936 --> 00:20.562
[exhales]

00:33.325 --> 00:35.369
[exhales]

00:37.538 --> 00:40.457
Ah, shit. I really thought
you'd do better than this.

00:42.125 --> 00:43.126
[clicks tongue]

00:48.173 --> 00:49.967
Why are you giving me this?

00:50.050 --> 00:53.011
Sunok, I think I really like you.

00:53.095 --> 00:54.221
You like me?

00:54.304 --> 00:55.305
Yeah.

00:59.309 --> 01:01.770
[Sunok giggles]
Hold on.

01:01.853 --> 01:03.605
[Male News Reporter] Up next...

01:03.689 --> 01:05.649
[Friend A] Pretty sure it's my turn.

01:05.732 --> 01:07.359
And here's the ribbon!

01:07.442 --> 01:08.527
[Friend B] Whoa!

01:08.610 --> 01:10.821
[Male News Reporter] In an effort
to boost areas hit hard by the decline

01:10.904 --> 01:12.114
of the coal industry...

01:12.197 --> 01:13.532
Hey, where's Sunok?

01:13.615 --> 01:14.950
-Mm, not sure.
-[Friend B] I don't know where she is.

01:15.033 --> 01:16.159
GOLD LAND HOTEL &amp; RESORT CONSTRUCTION SITE

01:16.243 --> 01:17.744
-[Friend A] Sunok needs to see this.
-[Friend B] She must be somewhere.

01:19.413 --> 01:20.664
[drum clangs]

01:21.832 --> 01:24.585
[gagging and struggling]

01:29.464 --> 01:32.009
[short gasps]

01:32.092 --> 01:33.093
[Henchman A] What the...

01:33.176 --> 01:34.386
Shit!

01:34.469 --> 01:35.470
[Henchman B] This crazy bastard!

01:35.554 --> 01:36.722
[Henchman A] Hold him, hold him!

01:36.805 --> 01:38.390
-[Henchman B] Fuck me.
-[Henchman A] That way.

01:39.516 --> 01:41.018
[Chairman Ahn] Come on.

01:41.101 --> 01:43.437
Don't be so rash.
You're still young.

01:44.604 --> 01:47.065
What you should be doing is working
to pay off your debts.

01:48.275 --> 01:50.736
How could I ever pay it all back?

01:50.819 --> 01:52.696
[Chairman Ahn laughing]
I know, right?

01:52.779 --> 01:54.573
On your police salary?

01:55.407 --> 01:58.118
Well, you should've known your place
before pushing it so far.

01:58.201 --> 01:59.453
[Young Jinman] I know, I know.

02:00.037 --> 02:03.040
Just kill me,
and only me, okay?

02:03.123 --> 02:05.667
But please leave
that innocent woman alone.

02:05.751 --> 02:07.002
I'm begging you.

02:07.627 --> 02:09.338
You don't need to pay us back.

02:10.172 --> 02:11.465
At least not entirely with money.

02:13.175 --> 02:14.635
[Chairman Ahn] Constable Kim Jinman.

02:16.470 --> 02:17.471
What if...

02:20.182 --> 02:22.309
You became my man instead, yeah?

02:25.896 --> 02:28.899
[♪ dramatic music]

03:01.640 --> 03:04.935
[♪ music continues]

03:13.402 --> 03:15.237
[inhales deeply]

03:15.320 --> 03:16.697
[exhales]

03:20.659 --> 03:23.662
[♪ sad piano music]
STYLE
::cue()

03:45.767 --> 03:48.770
[♪ music continues]

04:04.077 --> 04:05.745
EPISODE 7
VILLAINS

04:05.829 --> 04:08.832
[metal detector beeping]

04:17.007 --> 04:18.008
[light clicks]

04:18.091 --> 04:19.092
[items dropping]

04:19.968 --> 04:21.720
Why are you here?

04:23.513 --> 04:24.848
H-Heeju.

04:25.307 --> 04:26.516
[Heeju exhales]

04:27.476 --> 04:29.436
I told you not to come here, didn't I?

04:30.145 --> 04:32.230
-The gold bars aren't here.
-[Dokyung] Let's not do this.

04:32.814 --> 04:35.859
Let's just take the gold
and leave together.

04:35.942 --> 04:37.694
[Dokyung] I already made
the deal with the buyers.

04:37.778 --> 04:40.447
All we need to do is go to Cambodia
and show them the gold bars.

04:40.530 --> 04:42.532
We'll have 100 billion won in our account!

04:43.450 --> 04:44.951
I'm already giving you half.

04:45.744 --> 04:47.162
Isn't that enough?

04:47.245 --> 04:49.581
-Do you really have to take it all?
-Heeju.

04:57.297 --> 04:58.757
Heeju, what happened to you?

05:00.175 --> 05:01.802
Why are you doing this?

05:06.807 --> 05:07.808
[exhales sharply]

05:14.523 --> 05:16.024
So this is what it was like.

05:17.484 --> 05:18.860
The place you grew up in.

05:21.112 --> 05:22.697
[Dokyung] You said it was hell.

05:22.781 --> 05:24.282
So why are you here again?

05:25.575 --> 05:26.701
What happened to you?

05:28.829 --> 05:29.830
[inhales sharply]

05:30.580 --> 05:32.457
Look, if this is because
of something I've done...

05:34.167 --> 05:36.086
...at least give me a chance
to explain myself.

05:37.170 --> 05:39.548
You can do that, can't you?
After all we've been through?

05:41.341 --> 05:42.342
Dokyung.

05:44.427 --> 05:45.637
Look at us right now.

05:48.223 --> 05:49.391
This is the reason.

05:49.975 --> 05:52.435
This is why we shouldn't
be together any longer.

05:54.187 --> 05:55.605
Nothing happened.

05:55.689 --> 05:57.148
And we're not bad people.

05:58.275 --> 05:59.901
This is just how life is.

06:01.361 --> 06:03.154
When you win something really big.

06:05.156 --> 06:06.908
You have to lose something else.

06:07.868 --> 06:09.369
A thing that's less precious.

06:10.328 --> 06:11.496
[Heeju] And quite frankly...

06:12.664 --> 06:15.208
...I'm the one who has the gold now.
It's mine.

06:15.292 --> 06:17.711
It's up to me whether I share
it with you or not.

06:19.212 --> 06:20.213
Heeju.

06:22.173 --> 06:23.216
Get out.

06:24.718 --> 06:26.303
And don't ever look for me again.

06:28.346 --> 06:29.973
[Heeju] It's true that because of you...

06:31.057 --> 06:33.560
...I finally got out of the hell hole
I'd been living in.

06:35.228 --> 06:36.980
And being with you made me happy.

06:38.315 --> 06:41.526
But we can't be happy together anymore.
That's why it needs to end.

07:03.256 --> 07:07.886
[door creaks open and closed]

07:07.969 --> 07:09.304
[sniffles]

07:12.849 --> 07:15.852
[breathing shakily]
STYLE
::cue()

07:18.897 --> 07:20.440
[camera shutter clicking]

07:20.523 --> 07:23.526
[indistinct quiet chattering]

07:25.236 --> 07:28.239
[camera shutters clicking]

07:31.076 --> 07:32.160
-Thank you.
-Oh.

07:32.243 --> 07:33.370
Thank you very much.

07:33.453 --> 07:34.913
[both chuckling]

07:34.996 --> 07:37.999
[applause]

07:39.125 --> 07:40.126
That's great to hear.

07:40.210 --> 07:42.170
[all laughing]

07:42.253 --> 07:44.005
-And so it begins.
-Ah, look who it is!

07:44.089 --> 07:45.840
Sir, you're here.

07:45.924 --> 07:48.343
-[Governor] Mr. Ahn.
-Thank you for coming. I know you're busy.

07:48.426 --> 07:49.678
Well, how could I miss it?

07:49.761 --> 07:51.388
It's your business, Mr. Ahn.

07:51.471 --> 07:52.597
[all laughing]

07:52.681 --> 07:54.683
Oh, right.
This is our partner from Cambodia.

07:54.766 --> 07:55.767
-Ah.
-Our governor.

07:55.850 --> 07:56.935
-How do you do?
-Nice to meet you.

07:57.018 --> 07:58.019
-[Governor] Congratulations.
-[Socom] Thank you.

07:58.103 --> 07:59.688
-[Governor] Of course.
-[Socom] Yes.

07:59.771 --> 08:00.939
-Thank you.
-Thank you very much.

08:01.022 --> 08:01.981
-[Socom] Thank you.
-[Governor] It's been a pleasure.

08:02.065 --> 08:03.024
[Socom] Absolutely.

08:03.108 --> 08:04.067
[Chairman Ahn] And this
is the congressman.

08:04.150 --> 08:05.777
[Politician] I've been looking forward
to meeting you.

08:05.860 --> 08:08.863
[Chairman Ahn chewing and slurping]

08:11.908 --> 08:13.868
The actors played their parts well.

08:15.161 --> 08:16.913
Make sure everyone keeps their mouth shut.

08:16.996 --> 08:18.248
No loose lips.

08:19.833 --> 08:21.835
And I want this deal on
the front page tomorrow.

08:21.918 --> 08:23.128
Understood, sir.

08:24.462 --> 08:25.880
Those Cambodians.

08:25.964 --> 08:28.049
Stick 'em in a room and keep 'em happy.

08:28.508 --> 08:30.552
Drugs, drinks, women, whatever it takes.

08:30.635 --> 08:31.970
Don't want 'em getting ideas.

08:32.053 --> 08:33.680
-Yes, sir.
-[Chairman Ahn slurping]

08:33.763 --> 08:36.307
Ah, all this bullshit
for one single casket!

08:37.183 --> 08:38.184
[Jinman] Hello, sir.

08:38.268 --> 08:39.269
It's been a while.

08:51.197 --> 08:52.949
Where's the casket?

08:53.033 --> 08:54.034
[Chairman Ahn] Who took it?

08:55.285 --> 08:57.829
Yeah, well, it's, uh...

08:59.456 --> 09:00.457
It was this woman, right?

09:02.333 --> 09:03.585
-Yeah.
-[Jinman] It was?

09:03.668 --> 09:05.962
-[Donggu] Yeah.
-Look, different name.

09:06.588 --> 09:08.965
[Jinman] So it wasn't Cha Yujin.
It was Kim Heeju.

09:11.634 --> 09:13.511
The thing is, sir,
it's just...

09:14.262 --> 09:16.639
...we're talkin' about one ton
of gold bars, here.

09:16.723 --> 09:18.475
And having to smuggle and sell it?

09:19.309 --> 09:21.394
I don't think anyone could do
that by themselves.

09:22.353 --> 09:23.438
They must have had help.

09:23.521 --> 09:25.190
Someone else is pulling the strings?

09:26.816 --> 09:27.942
Suspect anyone?

09:28.026 --> 09:29.277
[Jinman] We'll find out
once we investigate.

09:30.653 --> 09:35.533
Although, with the police being involved,
it can get pretty risky.

09:35.617 --> 09:36.701
Do you want cash?

09:36.785 --> 09:37.786
[Jinman] Well, I...

09:39.037 --> 09:41.831
...I do always need more money, sir.

09:42.457 --> 09:43.875
How much you want?

09:44.793 --> 09:46.711
One gold bar.
That's it.

09:46.795 --> 09:47.796
That's all I want.

09:49.047 --> 09:50.423
[Jinman] Give me a week to work on this.

09:51.674 --> 09:53.510
I'll find all 100 gold bars.

09:54.803 --> 09:56.304
Keep one for myself.

09:56.387 --> 10:00.517
And then I'll return
the other 99 back to you, sir.

10:01.017 --> 10:02.894
What do you plan to do with one gold bar?

10:02.977 --> 10:06.481
Well, uh, you know,
I'm getting old now.

10:07.774 --> 10:09.692
I'm thinking of quitting the force.

10:09.776 --> 10:11.611
[Jinman] I wanna buy a pawnshop.

10:11.694 --> 10:14.155
Sit back and take it easy.
Play loan shark.

10:14.656 --> 10:16.282
[Jinman] Just live like that.

10:16.366 --> 10:19.911
I think I've done more than enough, sir.
That's a good end for me.

10:22.455 --> 10:25.125
[Chairman Ahn scoffs]
Sure.

10:26.000 --> 10:28.086
Bring the casket back,
and I'll give you one.

10:30.630 --> 10:31.881
[Jinman] Thank you, sir.

10:34.050 --> 10:35.635
If you need to get in touch,

10:35.718 --> 10:37.303
-go through Chief Cheon.
-Yes.

10:39.264 --> 10:41.975
Well, then, we have an agreement.
Excuse me.

10:44.352 --> 10:45.687
-[Chairman Ahn] Hey, Kim Jinman.
-Yes, sir.

10:47.230 --> 10:50.567
You knew about the gold all along
and you didn't lose your cool.
STYLE
::cue()

10:51.651 --> 10:52.902
[Chairman Ahn] You were first, right?

10:53.194 --> 10:54.279
To find out about it?

10:54.821 --> 10:56.739
You're the one who told Hocheol.

10:57.615 --> 10:58.658
But you never thought...

10:59.993 --> 11:02.453
"Should I just keep all the gold
and run away?"

11:02.537 --> 11:04.289
You never felt the urge
to do anything like that?

11:04.372 --> 11:05.582
[chewing]

11:06.708 --> 11:09.586
No, how could I?
I wouldn't touch your property, sir.

11:09.669 --> 11:10.962
[Chairman Ahn chuckles]

11:12.046 --> 11:13.089
[laughs]

11:13.173 --> 11:14.174
Right.

11:15.216 --> 11:17.135
You've always played it small,
haven't you?

11:18.761 --> 11:20.680
I once told him I'd take
his wife's kidney.

11:20.763 --> 11:23.474
[laughs]
He tried to hang himself.

11:23.558 --> 11:25.435
That's how freaked out he was.

11:26.144 --> 11:28.396
So I said I'd spare her life.

11:28.479 --> 11:32.483
And this man starts grovelling, begging.
"I'll do anything you say!"

11:33.651 --> 11:35.153
Just crying.

11:35.236 --> 11:37.322
[laughing]

11:37.405 --> 11:40.950
And that-that's why I like you,
Kim Jinman!

11:41.034 --> 11:42.493
You're still useful!

11:42.577 --> 11:45.580
[Chairman Ahn laughing]

11:48.333 --> 11:51.127
[Kang] Four five two one. No.

11:51.211 --> 11:53.087
How about this one here?

11:53.171 --> 11:55.131
JANGGAK TRADE INC.

11:55.215 --> 11:56.549
That's not it, either.

11:57.342 --> 11:59.510
Four three two oh.
Four three two oh.

11:59.594 --> 12:00.637
[grunts]

12:02.055 --> 12:04.974
[cell phone vibrating]

12:05.058 --> 12:07.477
Ah, shit.
What is it now?

12:10.438 --> 12:11.606
Yeah, what is it?

12:11.689 --> 12:14.609
[Jinman] Are you looking for
a five two seven nine Santa Fe?

12:14.692 --> 12:15.693
Yes.

12:16.402 --> 12:18.488
[Jinman] I'm here, fucker. Here.

12:18.571 --> 12:19.989
[clicks tongue]
Shit.

12:24.994 --> 12:27.747
Hey. I checked all
the cars here earlier today.

12:28.414 --> 12:29.415
It's not here.

12:31.167 --> 12:33.211
So then Park made you do this?

12:33.294 --> 12:35.338
No, Chairman Ahn.

12:35.421 --> 12:36.547
[groans]

12:36.631 --> 12:38.299
[Kang] Fuck, this is driving me crazy.

12:38.633 --> 12:39.801
[lip smacks]

12:41.135 --> 12:42.679
Hey, what's with that car, anyways?

12:43.263 --> 12:44.264
Is it Cha Yujin's?

12:44.764 --> 12:46.015
Well, I don't know.

12:49.310 --> 12:50.311
[Jinman] Hey.

12:51.562 --> 12:52.563
Thought you said you were done.

12:52.647 --> 12:55.233
You weren't gonna work for Geumsong,
so why are you?

12:55.900 --> 12:57.110
We lost Lee Dokyung.

12:58.653 --> 12:59.654
[both exhale sharply]

12:59.737 --> 13:00.738
[Jinman] Gosh.

13:00.822 --> 13:02.865
The department's already giving me hell
for this.

13:03.241 --> 13:04.450
Now the director, too.

13:05.118 --> 13:06.119
[clicks tongue]

13:08.997 --> 13:10.832
Just call it a night for now, yeah?

13:11.874 --> 13:15.211
My best guess is that there's a good
chance they got rid of it already.

13:15.295 --> 13:17.297
Probably dumped it in
a reservoir or something.

13:18.756 --> 13:22.093
Just tell Park that the car belonged
to Janggak Trading.

13:23.261 --> 13:25.096
[Kang] Right.
Yeah, that's a good call.

13:25.179 --> 13:26.180
Yeah.

13:28.850 --> 13:29.934
[exhales]

13:30.018 --> 13:33.021
[cell phone vibrating]

13:37.608 --> 13:38.609
You find it yet?

13:39.319 --> 13:41.237
[Kang] Uh, no.
No, not exactly.

13:42.780 --> 13:44.866
[inhales deeply]

13:46.617 --> 13:48.286
You're a stupid fuck.
You know that?

13:52.415 --> 13:55.585
Now wait. You see,
it's not a private vehicle.

13:55.668 --> 13:57.128
It belongs to a company.

13:57.962 --> 13:59.172
Fuck, which one?

13:59.630 --> 14:00.882
[Kang] It's called Janggak Trading.

14:01.591 --> 14:03.426
It looks like a trading company,

14:03.509 --> 14:05.553
but they buy cheap Chinese cars
and sell them overseas.

14:06.304 --> 14:07.472
Heo Donggu's company?

14:08.264 --> 14:09.891
[Kang] Yeah.
Do you know it?

14:11.893 --> 14:12.935
Good work.

14:13.936 --> 14:14.937
[phone beeps]
STYLE
::cue()

14:17.106 --> 14:20.109
[car engine rumbling]

14:20.735 --> 14:22.111
[Woogy] It's because my dad
suddenly collapsed.

14:22.195 --> 14:23.196
LETTER OF RESIGNATION

14:23.696 --> 14:26.574
I need to leave so I can help
him out on his farm.

14:27.116 --> 14:28.242
You're an orphan.

14:28.326 --> 14:29.535
Uh...

14:31.204 --> 14:32.955
...he's actually my uncle, not my dad.

14:33.039 --> 14:36.292
Do you think we're a real company
'cause we pay you a salary?

14:36.375 --> 14:38.503
You've always been able
to walk in as you please.

14:39.170 --> 14:41.464
I'll cut off your ear
if you wanna walk out, though.

14:42.882 --> 14:45.176
-Yes, I understand.
-You understand?

14:46.177 --> 14:47.512
Seriously?

14:47.595 --> 14:49.847
Just think it over.

14:49.931 --> 14:52.058
[Gitae] You won't make this kind
of money anywhere else.

14:52.141 --> 14:54.018
And you're one of our best.

14:55.520 --> 14:56.521
[door opens]

14:56.604 --> 14:58.648
Now get out.
Go on.

14:58.731 --> 15:01.400
Back to work, now!
Go, go, go, go.

15:05.154 --> 15:06.155
Hey.

15:11.119 --> 15:12.120
Sir.

15:15.414 --> 15:16.749
It was you.

15:16.833 --> 15:19.335
[both grunting]

15:20.920 --> 15:21.921
No, it wasn't!

15:24.132 --> 15:25.341
What do you mean?

15:27.468 --> 15:30.054
You're that kid whose ear
I almost took off, right?

15:31.806 --> 15:34.183
Uh, yes. That's correct.
[clears throat]

15:35.852 --> 15:36.936
It's still on there.

15:37.019 --> 15:39.522
Yes. It healed up well.

15:44.152 --> 15:45.278
Go on.

15:49.365 --> 15:52.076
[door creaking]

15:54.537 --> 15:55.580
[Gitae] Boss.

15:56.205 --> 15:57.498
Have a seat over here.

15:57.582 --> 15:59.167
[Gitae] Or should I call you President?

15:59.250 --> 16:01.043
You think I dragged myself here...

16:01.127 --> 16:02.211
[inhales]

16:02.295 --> 16:04.005
...just so I can sit in that chair again?

16:04.088 --> 16:07.425
That's true.
[laughs]

16:09.468 --> 16:11.012
Gitae, let's find the casket.

16:11.554 --> 16:13.055
Do you even know where it is?

16:14.932 --> 16:16.642
Well, come on, then!

16:16.726 --> 16:18.186
Let's go get it!

16:18.269 --> 16:20.938
And then, boom, your honor is back!

16:21.564 --> 16:22.690
[Gitae] We have to!

16:24.859 --> 16:28.738
[chuckling]

16:30.323 --> 16:31.782
[Woojin] It's Detective Kim.

16:31.866 --> 16:33.993
He thinks Janggak Trading is behind this.

16:34.785 --> 16:36.329
[Chairman Ahn] Janggak Trading?

16:36.412 --> 16:39.332
He told me you'd recognize
what that refers to.

16:40.166 --> 16:41.167
[grunts]

16:43.252 --> 16:44.545
[exhales]

16:46.589 --> 16:47.715
What's Janggak Trading?

16:48.466 --> 16:52.261
Oh, hello, sir.
Uh, it's Heo Donggu's company. Yeah.

16:52.345 --> 16:55.223
He was the man you kicked out, uh,
about ten years ago.

16:55.514 --> 16:57.725
-[Chairman Ahn] Oh.
-You remember, right?

16:57.808 --> 16:59.644
Okay, stay there.
Keep an eye on him.

17:01.270 --> 17:02.271
[phone beeps]

17:06.067 --> 17:08.903
Grab a few guys.
Head to Janggak Trading.

17:09.111 --> 17:10.112
When you get there,

17:10.196 --> 17:13.532
cut off Heo Donggu's other ear
and find the casket. Get moving.

17:14.200 --> 17:15.660
Yes, sir.

17:15.743 --> 17:17.787
[Man] Ah, let's go.

17:17.870 --> 17:19.163
[Woogy] Janggak Trading?

17:19.872 --> 17:20.873
Mm-hmm.

17:22.124 --> 17:23.709
You know what those guys do, right?

17:23.793 --> 17:25.127
And you're buying a ferry ticket there?

17:25.211 --> 17:26.504
[Heeju] I know.

17:27.255 --> 17:28.422
I got the car there.

17:30.883 --> 17:32.552
And that's where I got the bullets, too.

17:33.427 --> 17:36.305
Ah, just give half the gold bars
to Dokyung and let him figure it out!

17:36.973 --> 17:39.600
That bastard is an expert at smuggling!
He'll know what to do!

17:43.229 --> 17:46.190
[Woogy] Heeju, seriously.
What are you thinking? Huh?

17:47.024 --> 17:48.025
We're not doing this.

17:48.568 --> 17:49.569
'Kay?

17:50.361 --> 17:53.656
You're giving him half the gold.
Buying a ferry ticket.

17:54.073 --> 17:55.658
[Woogy] You can't think like that anymore.

17:56.742 --> 17:58.578
We have to start looking out
for ourselves first.

18:02.373 --> 18:03.749
[exhales]
[silverware clatters]

18:07.044 --> 18:08.212
[exhales sharply]
STYLE
::cue()

18:14.302 --> 18:19.599
JG JANGGAK TRADE INC.
TRADING/ TRANSPORT/ LOGISTICS

18:27.231 --> 18:28.608
[car engine shuts off]

18:29.525 --> 18:30.526
Heeju.

18:37.074 --> 18:38.242
The gold bars.

18:39.327 --> 18:40.536
Why don't you just tell me where they are?

18:41.829 --> 18:43.289
It'd be just in case.

18:43.372 --> 18:46.500
If anything bad were to happen to you,
then don't you think I should know?

18:46.584 --> 18:47.877
Woogy.

18:47.960 --> 18:48.961
Why don't we do this?

18:49.754 --> 18:51.172
You could schedule an E-mail.

18:51.255 --> 18:53.341
Write it in there,
set it to send later.

18:53.424 --> 18:55.718
And if you come back safely,
you could just delete it.

18:57.178 --> 18:59.180
So then if I were to come back safely...

19:00.097 --> 19:01.474
...you would just kill me, right?

19:03.309 --> 19:05.061
Right, I see why you'd think that.

19:06.854 --> 19:08.397
Heeju, just be careful.

19:08.481 --> 19:10.024
-I really mean it, okay?
-Okay.

19:10.107 --> 19:12.568
Seriously, those guys can be crazy.
You need to watch your back.

19:18.366 --> 19:20.618
[inhales and exhales sharply]

19:27.333 --> 19:28.334
[Jinman] Kim Heeju?

19:35.216 --> 19:36.258
What is this?

19:38.010 --> 19:39.011
[Donggu] Anywhere?

19:41.055 --> 19:42.056
I see.

19:44.350 --> 19:48.020
There's a ferry leaving Mokcheon Port
in two days, if that works for you.

19:48.104 --> 19:49.647
What are you loading?

19:49.730 --> 19:51.232
There's one car.

19:52.149 --> 19:53.359
And one passenger.

19:53.442 --> 19:54.735
Stow away?

19:56.112 --> 19:57.279
[Donggu exhales]

19:58.447 --> 20:00.449
That's not a cheap thing to do, you know.

20:01.492 --> 20:04.787
Ten million, even 20 million won
just won't cut it.

20:04.870 --> 20:07.248
These days,
pocket change isn't enough.

20:12.002 --> 20:13.629
[Heeju] Take this up front.

20:13.713 --> 20:16.799
Once the transport is done,
I'll give you another one.

20:29.562 --> 20:32.898
All right, Park, you asshole.
Just show up already.

20:35.568 --> 20:36.610
[tires squeak]

20:36.694 --> 20:38.028
[car door opens]

20:40.197 --> 20:42.074
[cell phone trilling]

20:42.158 --> 20:43.325
[Jinman] Hey, yeah, Chief Cheon.

20:43.409 --> 20:45.077
Park is here right now.
You coming or what?

20:47.079 --> 20:48.873
[Woogy] Is that Park?

20:52.877 --> 20:54.837
HEEJU, DIRECTOR PARK IS HERE.

20:54.920 --> 20:56.756
[cell phone vibrates]
[Donggu exhales]

20:59.925 --> 21:01.343
GET OUT OF THERE RIGHT NOW.

21:02.428 --> 21:03.471
What?

21:05.014 --> 21:06.724
[gasping]

21:07.558 --> 21:11.479
[Donggu] Wait. Did you mess around
with Geumseong's stuff?

21:11.562 --> 21:15.941
You did! Come here! Come over here!
Quickly! Go, go, go, go, go!

21:16.025 --> 21:17.610
Hide here!

21:18.694 --> 21:21.697
In here! Okay. Inside this!
You need to get in. Okay.

21:21.781 --> 21:25.409
They won't find you in here. Here!
Don't even breathe! Okay?

21:25.493 --> 21:28.245
Don't make any noise!
You need to stay hidden in here!

21:28.329 --> 21:30.581
[Donggu breathing erratically]
Okay, good. Good.

21:30.664 --> 21:32.833
[heavy breathing]

21:33.834 --> 21:35.878
[bullets clattering on floor]
Oh, fuck me!

21:36.962 --> 21:38.714
Oh, gosh, I don't know!

21:38.798 --> 21:39.965
Ah!

21:41.175 --> 21:43.511
Hey there, Donggu.
It's been a while.

21:43.594 --> 21:46.138
[groaning]

21:46.847 --> 21:50.226
Hey, I think there was a misunderstanding,
right?

21:51.227 --> 21:52.144
[Donggu] What?

21:52.228 --> 21:54.730
[all shouting]
[glass shattering]

21:54.814 --> 21:57.650
[Donggu whimpering]

21:57.733 --> 21:59.318
You know I don't say things I don't mean.

21:59.401 --> 22:01.529
[Hocheol] Where'd you hide the casket?

22:02.071 --> 22:04.031
Tell me or I'll take your other ear.

22:04.114 --> 22:05.491
This is all a misunderstanding!

22:05.574 --> 22:08.619
This isn't a funeral home!
Why would you look for a casket here?

22:08.702 --> 22:10.287
Wait!

22:10.788 --> 22:13.791
[screaming]

22:16.043 --> 22:17.086
Stop it!

22:17.545 --> 22:20.256
[Doggu screaming]
STYLE
::cue()

22:24.552 --> 22:26.053
[tires squealing]

22:26.554 --> 22:28.472
What the actual fuck?

22:28.556 --> 22:29.557
[Woojin] Get up there!

22:33.853 --> 22:35.104
[coughs]

22:37.523 --> 22:39.149
[Donggu screaming]

22:39.233 --> 22:42.862
Ju! Ju Haran! Ah!
It's Ju Haran!

22:42.945 --> 22:44.321
It's Ju Haran!

22:44.405 --> 22:46.073
Who is Ju Haran?

22:46.156 --> 22:49.159
[Donggu screaming]

22:50.286 --> 22:51.912
[banging on door]

22:51.996 --> 22:53.122
[Gitae] Oh, shit!

22:53.205 --> 22:55.249
[banging continues]
Hey, boss!

22:55.332 --> 22:56.667
-[Gitae] Hurry!
-Fuck's sake!

22:56.750 --> 22:57.793
Ju Haran!
Who the fuck is she?

22:57.877 --> 22:59.128
I'm answering you!

22:59.211 --> 23:00.212
[Gitae shouts]

23:00.296 --> 23:02.131
[Gitae groans]

23:02.214 --> 23:04.133
[shouting]

23:05.342 --> 23:06.635
Fuck, it reeks in here.

23:06.719 --> 23:08.470
[Donggu wailing]

23:08.554 --> 23:09.638
What's this?

23:09.722 --> 23:12.224
This a Geumsong Alumni reunion?

23:12.308 --> 23:14.143
[Woojin laughs]

23:15.352 --> 23:16.896
Ah, come on.

23:17.521 --> 23:19.231
I'm really disappointed in you, Park.

23:20.024 --> 23:21.442
[Woojin] The chairman gave you a chance.

23:22.234 --> 23:23.319
But you know what you are?

23:24.403 --> 23:25.779
You're too old school.

23:26.322 --> 23:27.656
It's fucking pathetic.

23:28.908 --> 23:30.576
Both of you are.

23:30.659 --> 23:31.827
You thought you could take
the chairman's casket

23:31.911 --> 23:33.203
and just get away with it?

23:33.287 --> 23:34.997
It was a rhetorical question, you fuck.

23:35.581 --> 23:37.708
[Woojin] 'Kay, last chance.

23:38.417 --> 23:40.210
Who'd like to be the first to talk?

23:40.294 --> 23:42.087
Where's the casket?

23:42.171 --> 23:43.714
Okay, listen. It's not like that.

23:43.797 --> 23:45.925
The boss and I came here for Donggu.

23:46.008 --> 23:47.635
-He's the one who stole the casket.
-[Donggu] Bullshit!

23:47.718 --> 23:49.845
-He took it.
-I don't fucking have it, you liar!

23:50.596 --> 23:52.848
[whimpers]
Just, fuck.

23:52.932 --> 23:54.642
Just give me a second to explain!

23:54.725 --> 23:56.018
[Donggu] That car?

23:56.101 --> 23:59.229
A week ago a lady called Ju Haran came by
and bought it from me.

23:59.313 --> 24:01.065
-Ju Haran, huh?
-[Donggu] Fuck, how many times

24:01.148 --> 24:03.317
do I have to tell you?
How do I explain this?

24:03.400 --> 24:05.569
I have no idea, really!
I don't know!

24:05.653 --> 24:07.321
I've never once seen the casket!

24:07.404 --> 24:09.698
[Donggu] All I did was to sell a car
to this woman named Ju Haran.

24:09.782 --> 24:12.534
You don't believe me?
Let me show you the contract she signed!

24:13.243 --> 24:14.244
Where is it?

24:15.454 --> 24:16.622
I'll get it!

24:22.461 --> 24:24.254
[footsteps stomping]

24:24.838 --> 24:26.882
It's here!
This one!

24:27.424 --> 24:30.886
[whimpering]

24:31.845 --> 24:33.389
What are you doing?

24:36.517 --> 24:37.559
[Gitae] Boss.

24:37.643 --> 24:39.353
Hand it over!

24:39.436 --> 24:41.438
[Gitae] They think we're the ones
who stole the casket!

24:43.524 --> 24:44.942
I'd like to see it now.

24:50.990 --> 24:53.242
Come and get it, you motherfucker.

24:53.325 --> 24:56.745
Wow. You're fucking stubborn.

24:58.122 --> 24:59.415
Keep him alive, okay?

25:01.125 --> 25:02.751
Wait!
[gasps]

25:06.797 --> 25:09.800
[blows landing]
[All grunting]

25:18.350 --> 25:21.353
[blade slicing]
[Henchman screaming]

25:29.820 --> 25:30.821
[blow lands]

25:33.532 --> 25:35.159
[glass shatters]

25:45.919 --> 25:48.505
[both groaning]

25:54.803 --> 25:57.389
[gunshot]
[groaning]

25:57.473 --> 25:58.474
[labored breathing]

25:58.557 --> 25:59.850
[gasps]

25:59.933 --> 26:01.602
[all breathing heavily]

26:01.685 --> 26:02.978
You fucking asshole!

26:03.771 --> 26:05.898
[glass shattering]

26:05.981 --> 26:07.441
[groans]

26:09.151 --> 26:10.736
Oh, fuck.

26:10.819 --> 26:13.572
[both grunting]

26:14.073 --> 26:16.158
[banging and grunting]

26:20.704 --> 26:21.789
[glass shatters]

26:24.083 --> 26:25.834
[panicked breathing]

26:25.918 --> 26:28.629
[both grunting]

26:30.047 --> 26:32.216
[pained groaning]

26:32.299 --> 26:33.634
Wait, wait, wait!

26:34.384 --> 26:37.930
Okay, okay! You win, Park!
You win, Park! You win, Park, okay?

26:38.013 --> 26:40.057
Just a sec.
Let's not do this.
STYLE
::cue()

26:40.140 --> 26:41.892
We'll let you go if you just apologize.

26:41.975 --> 26:43.519
[Woojin] We can just bring
any old document and-

26:43.602 --> 26:46.772
[screaming]
Shit, okay, never mind! I'm sorry, okay?

26:46.855 --> 26:48.440
Let's just find the casket!

26:48.524 --> 26:50.818
Then the Chairman'll spare your life,
right? Okay?

26:51.360 --> 26:52.945
I can explain everything.

26:53.028 --> 26:54.321
[Woojin screaming]

26:54.863 --> 26:55.906
Boss!

26:55.989 --> 26:57.407
[Gitae] Have you lost your mind?

26:57.491 --> 26:59.243
[Woojin groans]

26:59.326 --> 27:01.662
Shit. Fuck!

27:03.330 --> 27:04.498
[groaning]

27:04.998 --> 27:07.960
[pained groans]

27:08.043 --> 27:10.087
You wanna save him,
you better take him to the hospital.

27:10.170 --> 27:12.923
-[Hocheol grunts]
-[gagging]

27:15.425 --> 27:16.718
Boss!

27:16.802 --> 27:18.220
Oh, man.

27:18.804 --> 27:20.722
[door creaking]

27:20.806 --> 27:22.724
[Jinman] What the-
is Park running away?

27:22.808 --> 27:25.185
Shit. Shit.

27:25.727 --> 27:27.020
This fucking...

27:27.104 --> 27:29.356
[grunting]

27:31.567 --> 27:34.570
[car engine turns over]

27:41.785 --> 27:43.120
Oh, sh-

27:51.753 --> 27:54.256
What the fuck is even going on?

27:54.339 --> 27:57.301
Hey, what happened here?
Heo Donggu, what just happened?

27:57.384 --> 27:58.552
[Gitae] Oh, fuck!

27:58.635 --> 28:01.013
What do you think happened?
Just take a look around!

28:01.096 --> 28:03.223
Ju Haran, I'm looking for her.
Have you seen her?

28:03.307 --> 28:06.059
Ju Haran? Well, I dunno.
Look at this place. I dunno.

28:06.143 --> 28:08.687
I saw her walk in here with my own eyes,
you asshole!

28:08.770 --> 28:10.647
[Donggu] What are you talking about?
Nobody came here!

28:10.731 --> 28:12.149
Can't you see this mess?

28:12.232 --> 28:14.318
You motherfucker! If you're lying to me,
I swear I'll fucking kill you.

28:14.401 --> 28:16.820
I'm not lying! Why would I?
I'm not lying to you! I swear!

28:16.904 --> 28:17.905
[Gitae] Detective Kim!

28:17.988 --> 28:19.281
Over here!

28:19.823 --> 28:21.074
Help me out!

28:21.158 --> 28:22.743
-[Gitae] Please, hurry!
-This fucking...

28:22.826 --> 28:24.912
[Gitae] Detective Kim!
Come on, hurry up!

28:24.995 --> 28:27.497
-Get over here! Come on, hurry!
-What happened to Chief Cheon?

28:27.581 --> 28:28.790
[Gitae] Come on, get over here!

28:28.874 --> 28:30.876
[both speaking at once]

28:30.959 --> 28:32.210
[Jinman] Here we go.

28:33.045 --> 28:34.963
Get him out of here.

28:35.047 --> 28:36.214
-Stay with us, Chief Cheon!
-Shit.

28:36.298 --> 28:39.343
If you die, we'll all end up dead!
Come on, we gotta move!

28:39.426 --> 28:41.303
[Cheon coughing]

28:42.930 --> 28:44.890
Come on!

28:45.766 --> 28:47.142
Shit.

28:47.225 --> 28:48.810
[cell phone buzzing]
Oh!

28:49.227 --> 28:50.270
Hello? Heeju?

28:50.812 --> 28:52.397
Tell me what the fuck
is goin' on in there!

28:52.481 --> 28:54.232
[Heeju] Woogy, you have to run.

28:54.316 --> 28:56.234
Detective Kim is heading your way.

28:56.944 --> 28:58.195
What are you gonna-
[phone beeps]

28:58.278 --> 28:59.279
Hello?

29:00.280 --> 29:01.281
Shit.

29:01.365 --> 29:04.076
[Gitae] Chief Cheon!
Please, please, don't die!

29:04.743 --> 29:06.787
-Please don't die!
-[grunts]

29:06.870 --> 29:08.580
[Gitae] We're in big trouble.

29:11.667 --> 29:13.001
[Donggu] No!

29:13.794 --> 29:14.920
They're all gone.

29:15.003 --> 29:16.838
[both breathing heavily]

29:18.924 --> 29:20.509
You can come out now.

29:22.302 --> 29:24.388
[footsteps on broken glass]

29:32.187 --> 29:33.188
[Donggu] Listen.

29:33.772 --> 29:34.940
Let's make a deal.

29:36.566 --> 29:38.819
Those men,
the ones that were here,

29:38.902 --> 29:40.278
I'm not like them at all.

29:41.113 --> 29:42.781
[Donggu] And I'm not that greedy, either.

29:43.699 --> 29:46.201
I'm not ambitious.

29:46.284 --> 29:48.662
All I'd like is to live a long life.

29:49.413 --> 29:53.458
And drugs, I'm out of that business.
I cut all connections ten years ago!

29:53.542 --> 29:54.918
I'm my own man now.

29:55.752 --> 29:57.004
The casket...

29:58.255 --> 30:01.216
Listen, shit, I really don't care
about it at all.

30:02.134 --> 30:04.428
Why else would I hide you in that cabinet?

30:04.511 --> 30:07.973
I hid you and I didn't tell those guys
that you're actually Kim Heeju,

30:08.056 --> 30:09.307
not Ju Haran.

30:11.810 --> 30:13.228
So what do you want from me?

30:15.731 --> 30:17.065
The transport fee.

30:18.275 --> 30:19.568
Ten gold bars.

30:20.235 --> 30:21.361
One billion won?

30:23.321 --> 30:24.990
We can negotiate, too.

30:25.073 --> 30:27.909
And also, uh,
after sales service?

30:27.993 --> 30:30.370
I'll take full responsibility
for everything right up till the end!

30:30.454 --> 30:31.455
I swear it!

30:33.206 --> 30:34.374
[Donggu] I mean it.

30:35.000 --> 30:36.543
[car alarm beeps]

30:36.626 --> 30:39.337
[Donggu inhales]
Look, that car over there.

30:39.838 --> 30:42.841
It's collateral I got yesterday.
You can take it. It's on me.

30:43.759 --> 30:45.260
I haven't even taken it to the garage yet.

30:45.343 --> 30:48.847
Feel free to drive it as much as you want,
and then get rid of it.

30:48.930 --> 30:51.725
[car engine revving]
STYLE
::cue()

31:02.652 --> 31:04.196
You can rest now.

31:07.407 --> 31:09.910
[♪ tense music]

31:09.993 --> 31:12.579
No need to make a big deal out of it.
Just have him cremated.

31:12.662 --> 31:13.663
Yes, sir.

31:14.206 --> 31:16.666
-Let Kim Jinman take care of the rest.
-Yes, sir.

31:17.084 --> 31:18.585
Have you found Park Hocheol yet?

31:19.544 --> 31:20.670
No.

31:20.754 --> 31:21.755
What?

31:23.173 --> 31:26.093
Get out there and find him immediately
before I rip each and every one of you

31:26.176 --> 31:27.511
-into fucking pieces!
-Right away.

31:36.311 --> 31:37.938
[Chairman Ahn] Are you doing okay, Ko?

31:38.605 --> 31:39.773
Yes, I'm okay, sir.

31:41.316 --> 31:43.568
[Chairman Ahn] Did you really not know
that Park had a lead?

31:44.486 --> 31:46.071
On the casket?

31:46.571 --> 31:50.325
[Jinman] Well, I hadn't really considered
that he would still be after it, sir.

31:50.408 --> 31:54.621
Honestly, uh,
I thought he'd gone back to Yes Money

31:54.704 --> 31:56.623
-and just given up on it.
-Whatever.

31:56.706 --> 31:59.167
Now bring me either Lee Dokyung
or Ju Haran.

31:59.251 --> 32:02.629
You're supposed to be the expert on this.
Just do your job.

32:02.712 --> 32:04.548
Then I'll get 'em to talk.

32:05.340 --> 32:06.967
Let's stick to what we're good at.

32:07.759 --> 32:08.760
Yes, sir.

32:09.344 --> 32:13.181
But if Park Hocheol finds that girl
or the casket before you do...

32:14.307 --> 32:16.643
...you can kiss one of your ears goodbye.

32:16.726 --> 32:17.894
[Jinman grunts]

32:24.693 --> 32:27.696
HAENGBOK PAWNSHOP

32:32.659 --> 32:35.662
[door rattling]

32:39.875 --> 32:42.878
[distant clocks quietly ticking]

32:52.095 --> 32:53.471
[door creaks]

33:03.899 --> 33:06.067
[grunts]

33:06.151 --> 33:07.152
[clunks]

33:09.988 --> 33:12.115
[gold bars scraping]

33:18.788 --> 33:21.791
[♪ dramatic music]

33:32.928 --> 33:34.512
[exhales]

33:46.233 --> 33:47.651
[cell phone vibrating]

33:47.984 --> 33:51.112
INCOMING CALL
SUNOK

33:52.489 --> 33:53.865
[vibrating continues]

33:53.949 --> 33:54.991
[phone clicks]

33:56.243 --> 33:57.244
Hello?

33:58.453 --> 33:59.871
[Sunok] Can I see you for a bit?

34:03.083 --> 34:04.084
Now?

34:06.044 --> 34:07.254
Uh...

34:08.713 --> 34:09.798
Okay.

34:10.840 --> 34:11.841
Be right there.
STYLE
::cue()

34:14.386 --> 34:15.387
[phone beeps]

34:17.847 --> 34:19.891
Ah, dammit.

34:19.975 --> 34:22.978
[car engine revving]

34:38.410 --> 34:41.413
[inhales on cigarette]

34:46.167 --> 34:50.797
VEHICLE TRANSFER CERTIFICATE
JU HARAN

34:50.880 --> 34:52.007
Ju Haran.

34:52.090 --> 34:54.551
I've heard that name before.
Fuck.

34:56.428 --> 34:57.637
Dammit.

34:59.306 --> 35:00.515
[exhales]

35:02.892 --> 35:04.686
That's the bitch I killed.

35:07.939 --> 35:08.940
[exhales]

35:10.734 --> 35:12.068
[chuckles]

35:12.527 --> 35:19.534
YES MONEY

35:25.582 --> 35:26.958
[inhales]

35:36.051 --> 35:38.386
[knocking on door]
[Moonsu] Boss.

35:38.470 --> 35:40.013
-Boss.
-[Gitae] What?

35:40.096 --> 35:42.015
Did you see a ghost or something?

35:42.098 --> 35:44.225
[all gasping]

35:45.101 --> 35:46.227
[door closes]

35:46.895 --> 35:47.979
Sir, what're...

35:50.398 --> 35:52.317
Nobody saw anything,
so keep your mouth shut.

35:53.568 --> 35:55.153
And no makin' any phone calls!

35:55.236 --> 35:56.696
-[Both] Yes, sir.
-[Gitae] Now get the fuck out.

35:56.780 --> 35:57.864
Shut the door.

35:58.865 --> 36:00.575
[Gitae exhales]
Why'd you come here?

36:01.868 --> 36:03.286
[door closes]

36:03.370 --> 36:04.579
You know you're being hunted.

36:04.663 --> 36:06.998
The Geumseong guys
are all over looking for you.

36:07.082 --> 36:08.750
[exhales]

36:08.833 --> 36:10.168
Where else should I go?

36:11.211 --> 36:12.504
This here is my turf.

36:13.380 --> 36:14.923
You know Chief Cheon died, right?

36:15.382 --> 36:16.466
He was cremated.

36:17.175 --> 36:19.010
-Yeah?
-Leave Jeongsan.

36:19.761 --> 36:21.721
Chairman Ahn will find out you were here.

36:21.805 --> 36:23.348
And then he'll murder us both.

36:24.099 --> 36:25.558
[exhales]

36:25.642 --> 36:26.893
Where's Ju Haran?

36:29.479 --> 36:30.480
I don't know.

36:32.232 --> 36:34.025
The Geumseong guys must be looking
for her.

36:35.402 --> 36:36.403
Gitae.

36:38.738 --> 36:40.532
Do you know who Ju Haran is?

36:41.950 --> 36:42.992
No, who?

36:43.493 --> 36:44.828
You know Gu Jaok, right?

36:45.662 --> 36:47.789
She's the largest backer in Gangwon.

36:49.082 --> 36:52.711
There's no one in Jeongsan who hasn't
set foot on land that old lady owns.

36:53.545 --> 36:55.630
Ju Haran is her granddaughter.

36:55.714 --> 36:56.715
What?

36:57.549 --> 36:58.717
Around a year ago...

36:59.676 --> 37:03.596
...Chairman Ahn wanted to buy the 2%
of Gu's stake in Gold Land.

37:05.432 --> 37:08.393
That would have made him Gold Land's
biggest shareholder.

37:08.893 --> 37:10.854
However, Ms. Gu knew what he was doing...

37:12.272 --> 37:14.315
...and she refused to hand over her stake.

37:15.066 --> 37:17.569
So I found her collateral,
and took it from her.

37:19.154 --> 37:20.155
Ju Haran.

37:20.989 --> 37:22.615
[Gitae] So what's going on?

37:23.116 --> 37:27.787
If Ju is her granddaughter,
she took the casket...

37:28.913 --> 37:31.082
...is Ms. Gu the one behind all this?

37:31.166 --> 37:33.126
No, that's not it.

37:35.378 --> 37:36.838
Ju Haran's already dead.
STYLE
::cue()

37:37.839 --> 37:39.007
I killed her.

37:40.008 --> 37:42.802
Mr. Jin took care of the body
and dumped it at the farm.

37:43.470 --> 37:46.473
Well then, who's the Ju Haran
with the casket now?

37:46.556 --> 37:48.183
She's a fake.

37:48.266 --> 37:50.018
[Hocheol] Someone's pretending
to be Ju Haran,

37:50.101 --> 37:51.770
and they've even been using her ID.

37:53.021 --> 37:54.481
But as you probably know...

37:55.774 --> 37:57.984
...we're supposed to keep hold
of every ID card.

37:58.860 --> 38:00.403
[inhales]

38:01.154 --> 38:03.907
That's right. ID card.

38:06.868 --> 38:07.869
[Gitae] Let's see.

38:07.952 --> 38:09.329
Fuck.

38:09.412 --> 38:10.747
Where is it?

38:20.131 --> 38:22.425
[breathing heavily]

38:22.967 --> 38:23.968
[Gitae] What's this?

38:27.096 --> 38:28.973
Her ID card is missing.

38:32.811 --> 38:34.896
[stammering]
I didn't do it!

38:35.772 --> 38:36.981
[Hocheol] Then who was it?

38:37.816 --> 38:39.025
Who has access to them?

38:42.779 --> 38:44.030
Someone with access.

38:44.113 --> 38:45.365
Who's here alone.

38:46.157 --> 38:47.158
Woogy.

38:47.992 --> 38:50.370
[Gitae] That fucking punk that handles
the office supplies and the cleaning,

38:50.453 --> 38:51.746
all that stuff.

38:51.830 --> 38:53.498
Where's that bastard now?

38:53.581 --> 38:55.583
He tried to leave the company recently.

38:56.459 --> 38:57.627
That piece of shit.

38:59.087 --> 39:00.129
Hey, Moonsu!

39:01.005 --> 39:02.924
-Yes, Boss?
-[Gitae] You work with Woogy, right?

39:03.174 --> 39:04.175
Yes.

39:04.259 --> 39:06.761
Go find him!
Find him and bring him here!

39:06.845 --> 39:08.221
But Woogy already quit.

39:08.721 --> 39:10.014
Yeah, no shit, you dumb ass!

39:10.098 --> 39:11.975
So fucking bring him to me right now!

39:12.308 --> 39:13.309
Yes, right away.

39:13.393 --> 39:14.978
[door creaks]

39:15.895 --> 39:18.273
[distant footsteps stomping away]

39:18.356 --> 39:21.067
So, what are you gonna do now, Boss?

39:21.150 --> 39:22.402
[Hocheol] What about you?

39:22.485 --> 39:23.903
What are you gonna do?

39:25.238 --> 39:27.073
I'm already tracking down
the fake Ju Haran

39:27.156 --> 39:28.491
and I'm close to finding her.

39:30.201 --> 39:33.246
You can go get that thief
who stole her ID card from us.

39:33.329 --> 39:35.248
After that, we find the casket.

39:35.707 --> 39:36.708
[Gitae] So then...

39:37.292 --> 39:41.129
Wait a sec. Find the casket.
I know that's what you want.

39:42.005 --> 39:44.299
But we'll need to double cross Geumseong
for it.

39:45.133 --> 39:46.885
Do you really think that's worth it?

39:49.137 --> 39:50.930
You don't even know what's inside of it,
do you?

39:51.014 --> 39:52.724
Obviously drugs!

39:52.807 --> 39:54.809
They're a pain in the ass to sell,
ya know?

39:55.310 --> 39:56.936
Gold bars.

39:58.521 --> 39:59.731
One ton.

40:01.316 --> 40:03.526
It's worth 150 billion won.

40:09.115 --> 40:11.492
Now do you get why I turned against Ahn?

40:13.119 --> 40:14.579
[exhales]

40:16.080 --> 40:17.081
But...

40:19.000 --> 40:22.503
...if it's that kind of money,
Chairman Ahn's not just gonna give up.

40:23.379 --> 40:26.799
If he loses that casket,
he'll end up in one of his own.

40:26.883 --> 40:28.843
[Hocheol] That's the investment money
from Cambodia

40:28.927 --> 40:30.720
for the joint Gold Resort development.

40:31.471 --> 40:35.058
If the deal falls through
and they don't get their principal back...

40:37.226 --> 40:38.853
...they're not just gonna
let him walk away.

40:40.605 --> 40:42.231
[Hocheol] Now, you need to decide.

40:45.401 --> 40:46.945
Whose side are you on?

40:50.031 --> 40:51.491
'Cause I'm all in.

40:52.241 --> 40:54.202
[inhales deeply]

40:54.285 --> 40:55.870
[exhales]

40:55.954 --> 40:58.289
[cigarette rubbing on ashtray]
STYLE
::cue()

41:20.186 --> 41:21.270
You're here.

41:21.354 --> 41:22.480
Yeah.

41:26.484 --> 41:28.111
That a side effect of the chemo?

41:29.487 --> 41:31.447
[Jinman] Well, at least
you're getting treatment.

41:31.531 --> 41:32.699
You'll be good soon.

41:35.535 --> 41:36.911
Tomorrow's my surgery.

41:37.870 --> 41:39.706
Really? That's good to hear.

41:40.623 --> 41:41.791
I hope it goes well.

41:43.126 --> 41:44.377
[Jinman] Better sooner than later.

41:48.172 --> 41:49.424
Will your niece be here?

41:49.507 --> 41:50.508
No.

41:54.345 --> 41:56.347
I called because I wanted
to see your face.

41:58.516 --> 42:00.601
Might be the last time I see you.

42:01.227 --> 42:03.896
What are you talking about?
Come on.

42:04.897 --> 42:05.898
Don't know.

42:07.525 --> 42:08.568
[grunts]

42:08.651 --> 42:10.111
I just have a feeling it might.

42:10.820 --> 42:12.280
[Jinman] You're talking nonsense now.

42:12.905 --> 42:13.990
Jeez.

42:14.073 --> 42:15.074
[clicks tongue]

42:16.451 --> 42:17.577
Could...

42:17.660 --> 42:18.911
[inhales]

42:18.995 --> 42:21.414
Could you give me a bath tonight?

42:22.206 --> 42:23.374
A bath?

42:24.250 --> 42:25.251
Mm-hmm.

42:27.170 --> 42:28.379
You remember...

42:30.590 --> 42:32.842
...when we were young
and I'd come home drunk...

42:33.468 --> 42:34.886
...you would help wash me up?

42:34.969 --> 42:36.012
[chuckles]

42:38.389 --> 42:39.766
I did?

42:40.725 --> 42:41.976
If I'm going to die...

42:44.353 --> 42:46.355
...I wanna die with some grace.

42:48.775 --> 42:51.778
[water running]

42:55.031 --> 42:56.115
[Sunok] Looking back...

42:57.867 --> 43:00.119
...that really was the spring time
of my life.

43:03.331 --> 43:04.582
Living in Namju.

43:07.585 --> 43:08.711
With you.

43:08.795 --> 43:10.922
The two of us in that little mining town.

43:12.673 --> 43:14.509
[water wringing from hair]

43:14.592 --> 43:15.593
Yeah.

43:16.928 --> 43:18.638
I barely remember those days.

43:23.768 --> 43:25.603
I resented you afterward.

43:26.813 --> 43:27.897
For quite a while.

43:31.692 --> 43:34.487
I always wished that you
hadn't disappeared so suddenly.

43:37.115 --> 43:38.449
Even if I stayed...

43:43.663 --> 43:45.123
[Jinman] Fucking hell.

43:45.206 --> 43:46.499
What kind of a man were you with?

43:46.582 --> 43:47.583
Fuck.

43:48.292 --> 43:49.544
[exhales]

43:49.627 --> 43:52.755
That's what happens when you're nothing
but bad luck.

43:53.464 --> 43:54.715
[clicks tongue]

43:54.799 --> 43:55.883
[Sunok] But back then...

43:56.801 --> 43:58.803
...it really was all I could do
to survive.

44:01.514 --> 44:03.599
The years I spent living with that man...

44:06.144 --> 44:07.603
...they were nothing but hell.

44:10.898 --> 44:13.484
It felt like it wouldn't end until one
of us died.

44:14.986 --> 44:16.028
[Sunok] But...

44:17.613 --> 44:19.323
...the thought of being
the first to die...

44:23.286 --> 44:24.579
...that seemed too unfair.

44:26.622 --> 44:27.748
[exhales]

44:27.832 --> 44:28.833
[Sunok] So then...

44:29.625 --> 44:30.793
...I killed him.

44:30.877 --> 44:32.044
[inhales]

44:33.880 --> 44:36.340
Han Cheoljung, that bastard.

44:38.801 --> 44:40.052
I killed him.

45:00.698 --> 45:01.908
[Jinman clears throat]
STYLE
::cue()

45:19.675 --> 45:21.093
[Jinman] I'll cut it now.

45:32.188 --> 45:34.565
[Jinman] You have a nice head shape.
Don't worry.

45:35.650 --> 45:38.861
There was that bald singer from the UK.
You used to like her, didn't you?

45:38.945 --> 45:41.572
You kind of look like her.
You look pretty.

45:41.656 --> 45:42.823
Not bad, right?

45:43.366 --> 45:44.617
[groans]

45:45.117 --> 45:46.202
[exhales]

45:55.419 --> 45:56.963
Heeju isn't my niece.

45:59.090 --> 46:00.549
She's my daughter.

46:00.633 --> 46:01.634
What?

46:06.597 --> 46:08.057
And you're her father.

46:10.017 --> 46:11.269
[Sunok] After you left...

46:12.144 --> 46:14.272
...I found out that I was pregnant.

46:16.732 --> 46:18.985
The house where we lived together
in Namju...

46:20.486 --> 46:21.904
...that's where Heeju was born.

46:23.155 --> 46:25.283
[chuckles]

46:26.117 --> 46:27.910
You're kidding, right?

46:28.536 --> 46:29.537
It's a joke.

46:31.163 --> 46:32.415
[Jinman] That doesn't make any sense.

46:33.249 --> 46:35.668
I was going to keep it
a secret until I died.

46:36.836 --> 46:39.046
I didn't think I'd see you again.

46:39.880 --> 46:40.965
Okay, then.

46:41.048 --> 46:42.341
Why say all of this now?

46:43.968 --> 46:44.969
Jinman.

46:46.512 --> 46:48.514
[grunting]

46:51.058 --> 46:52.059
Heeju...

46:53.185 --> 46:56.022
I think she's unhappy nowadays.

46:57.606 --> 46:59.150
She's in trouble.

47:00.693 --> 47:02.153
And it's all because of me, I know.

47:03.529 --> 47:06.198
I just can't be buried with all
of that guilt.

47:06.949 --> 47:09.118
[Sunok] Not when it was me
who made her that way.

47:10.161 --> 47:12.371
I've always told her she
was a luckless brat...

47:13.497 --> 47:15.333
...born from a luckless bitch.

47:17.626 --> 47:18.627
So could you...

47:19.670 --> 47:21.297
...could you please take care of her?

47:23.299 --> 47:25.509
[Sunok] Don't let her ruin
her life any further.

47:25.843 --> 47:28.429
Keep her out of prison
and safe from bad men.

47:28.512 --> 47:29.805
[sniffles]

47:29.889 --> 47:31.390
You're a police officer.

47:31.974 --> 47:33.017
And her dad.

47:33.601 --> 47:36.687
-So you need to protect your daughter now.
-[Jinman] Enough.

47:38.272 --> 47:39.440
[exhales]
Hey.

47:40.858 --> 47:43.444
Listen, I just have to ask,
how am I supposed to believe you?

47:43.903 --> 47:44.904
Huh?

47:45.696 --> 47:48.949
You were a working girl.
A lady of the night.

47:49.033 --> 47:50.284
[Sunok] What?

47:50.368 --> 47:51.619
[scoffs]

47:51.702 --> 47:53.287
You mean when I was a hostess?

47:53.996 --> 47:54.997
[Jinman] Yeah.

47:55.289 --> 47:56.290
I mean...

47:57.041 --> 47:59.460
...seriously, how the fuck would
I know whose daughter she is?

48:00.044 --> 48:01.045
I wouldn't.

48:01.128 --> 48:02.213
I do, though.

48:03.881 --> 48:05.508
You were the only one I was with then.

48:10.721 --> 48:13.432
[inhales]
Shit, this is really fucked.

48:17.686 --> 48:19.271
[Jinman groans]

48:20.815 --> 48:22.233
[smacks lips]

48:22.316 --> 48:23.984
[Jinman] Shit.

48:27.571 --> 48:28.572
[clicks tongue]

48:29.907 --> 48:34.036
Hey. Have you told her, you know, that-

48:34.120 --> 48:35.704
that I'm, uh-I'm her dad?

48:35.788 --> 48:37.581
Or, does she know?

48:38.541 --> 48:39.583
I haven't.

48:41.168 --> 48:43.003
Heeju believes her father's dead.

48:45.798 --> 48:49.844
Would you tell your daughter
that her father was a gambling addict...

48:50.803 --> 48:52.763
...who ran off and abandoned her?

48:53.431 --> 48:54.974
That's good, then, yeah?

48:55.558 --> 48:57.309
Just keep it that way, okay?

48:58.102 --> 49:00.187
'Cause I-
I'm not her father.

49:00.271 --> 49:02.356
[Jinman] Got it?
Don't tell her.

49:03.065 --> 49:05.943
If you tell her I'm her father,
or anything like that,

49:06.026 --> 49:09.488
you, me, and her,
we're all gonna be fucked.

49:11.490 --> 49:13.242
The three of us will die.

49:13.325 --> 49:14.326
[Jinman] Understand?

49:15.494 --> 49:17.496
So stop saying nonsense.

49:18.414 --> 49:19.582
Seriously.

49:19.665 --> 49:20.666
[clicks tongue]

49:31.427 --> 49:34.221
[door opens and closes]

49:34.305 --> 49:35.806
[exhales]
STYLE
::cue()

49:48.944 --> 49:50.237
[brakes squeak]

49:51.947 --> 49:54.950
[chains rattling]

50:01.999 --> 50:05.002
[door scraping]

50:21.310 --> 50:22.603
[brakes squeak]

50:32.363 --> 50:33.989
[beeping]

50:37.201 --> 50:38.661
[creaking]

50:47.586 --> 50:49.296
[exhales]

50:50.256 --> 50:52.925
[Heeju] Mokcheon Port, 9:00 p.m. tomorrow.

50:55.386 --> 50:56.428
See you there.

51:05.145 --> 51:08.148
[inhales and exhales sharply]

51:10.901 --> 51:13.904
[cell phone vibrating]

51:16.115 --> 51:18.450
INCOMING CALL
AUNTIE MIJA

51:20.411 --> 51:21.870
Hey, Auntie.

51:22.371 --> 51:23.664
Hey.

51:23.747 --> 51:25.124
Are you coming today?

51:27.042 --> 51:28.586
[Mija] Why aren't you saying anything?

51:28.669 --> 51:29.753
[exhales]

51:29.837 --> 51:32.881
You should be here.
Your mom might be dying.

51:33.465 --> 51:35.634
Ah, I just have a bad feeling.

51:35.718 --> 51:37.386
I really think you should come.

51:39.471 --> 51:40.556
Okay.

51:45.436 --> 51:46.645
[exhales]

51:51.650 --> 51:52.776
[Mija] Sunok.

51:53.277 --> 51:54.945
Everything will be all right.

51:55.654 --> 51:57.990
Just stay calm. Okay?

51:58.782 --> 51:59.783
RESTRICTED AREA
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

51:59.867 --> 52:02.161
Oh, and Heeju will be here soon.

52:02.828 --> 52:03.871
See you later!

52:04.705 --> 52:07.708
[♪ dramatic music]

52:13.589 --> 52:19.261
GANGWON SAEBAEK HOSPITAL

52:20.304 --> 52:21.764
[Heeju] Is it over already?

52:21.847 --> 52:22.848
Yeah.

52:22.931 --> 52:24.058
[sniffs]

52:24.808 --> 52:26.602
They closed her up right away.

52:28.854 --> 52:31.273
I spoke with the doctor
before I called you.

52:32.066 --> 52:34.693
They said from here on out,
chemo won't help her.

52:36.695 --> 52:38.322
So she should go home.

52:38.781 --> 52:40.991
And spend the rest
of her time with family.

52:41.075 --> 52:43.160
[breathing shakily]

52:43.243 --> 52:44.536
Where are you right now?

52:45.621 --> 52:47.206
Why aren't you over here?

52:50.668 --> 52:51.752
[phone beeps]

52:55.964 --> 52:57.424
[shudders]

53:01.637 --> 53:04.640
[machines beeping]

53:07.059 --> 53:10.062
[♪ dramatic music]

53:18.320 --> 53:19.780
Hi, Mom.

53:30.457 --> 53:33.585
GANGWON SAEBAEK HOSPITAL
EMERGENCY CENTER

53:36.046 --> 53:39.049
[breathing heavily]

54:09.496 --> 54:12.499
[♪ dramatic music continues]

54:40.527 --> 54:43.530
[♪ music continues]
